{"4391870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bounty Pro Pulling", "steam_appid": 4391870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truck and tractor pulling is finally here. Built for hardcore pulling fans, Bounty Pro Pulling brings deep tuning, custom paint, serious sled setup, and online competition from the DNA of Bounty Drag Racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >25 Vehicles to Build Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Semi Trucks, 4x4 Diesels, 4x4 Pro Mods, Pro Stock Tractors, 2WD Modifieds, Light Modifieds, Mini Modifieds, and Unlimited Modifieds inspired by pulling machines from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391870/extras/60d83eef7d97e5260f06cd36561912cd.avif?t=1781324010\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391870/extras_big/60d83eef7d97e5260f06cd36561912cd.webp?t=1781324010 width=1560 height=875 /></span>Fully Adjustable Sled Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the sled like the real thing by adjusting sled weight, weight box speed, and where the pan drops during the pull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Track That Changes Every Pull</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As more vehicles run, the dirt gets looser. Move the sled, read the surface, and find the best line before your next pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Indoor and Outdoor Venues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull in both outdoor and indoor arenas, each with the proper exhaust setup for the venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Blow Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical damage means tuning and driving matter. Push too hard, and your machine may not survive the full run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own pulling tracks with a fully featured in-game track editor. Recreate your favorite venues without external downloads or mods.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truck and tractor pulling is finally here. Built for hardcore pulling fans, Bounty Pro Pulling brings deep tuning, custom paint, serious sled setup, and online competition from the DNA of Bounty Drag Racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >25 Vehicles to Build Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Semi Trucks, 4x4 Diesels, 4x4 Pro Mods, Pro Stock Tractors, 2WD Modifieds, Light Modifieds, Mini Modifieds, and Unlimited Modifieds inspired by pulling machines from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391870/extras/60d83eef7d97e5260f06cd36561912cd.avif?t=1781324010\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391870/extras_big/60d83eef7d97e5260f06cd36561912cd.webp?t=1781324010 width=1560 height=875 /></span>Fully Adjustable Sled Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the sled like the real thing by adjusting sled weight, weight box speed, and where the pan drops during the pull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Track That Changes Every Pull</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As more vehicles run, the dirt gets looser. Move the sled, read the surface, and find the best line before your next pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Indoor and Outdoor Venues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull in both outdoor and indoor arenas, each with the proper exhaust setup for the venue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Blow Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanical damage means tuning and driving matter. Push too hard, and your machine may not survive the full run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own pulling tracks with a fully featured in-game track editor. Recreate your favorite venues without external downloads or mods.</p>", "short_description": "The first Truck and Tractor Pulling game! Customize your vehicle, name it, tune it, and hop online to compete against others in the most realistic Pulling game yet. Bounty Pro Pulling has in depth tuning, paintable vehicles, and online competitions to test yourself against pullers across the world.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391870/be30e67c47661d0d6b7da66f3406735983b2f68a/header.jpg?t=1781324010", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391870/94c92671d7d9b0dd18ab51edccb07859409949d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781324010", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391870/94c92671d7d9b0dd18ab51edccb07859409949d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781324010", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Modern 8 Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</s